# Jak 3's Light Jak by the left grip and Y (LIST-0.1.6 item 12; a player on 0.1.5: "dark jak works in 3 but light jak
# not work"), run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=templea-start JAKVR_TEST_GUN=all JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1 (both meters full while
# he is neither, every Light Jak power given): the opening skipped as jak3_darkjak.sim, then in the temple on foot (the
# fists on the grips). 1: the grip held, Y pressed and let go (Triangle: full health, so no heal; he stands again, not
# Dark Jak). 2: the grip held, Y, then B (the shield). 3: Y, then A (the wings). 4: Y, the thumb slid to X (time
# slows). Each power ended by the right stick's click (R2). 5: Y tapped and everything let go at once (the heal still
# taken, not Dark Jak). 6: the grip held and Y, the grip let go before a choice with Y still held (L2 alone: Dark Jak,
# and no Triangle while Y stays held), then L2 again to end him. 7: the grip alone (the left fist, as ever). Expect
# "[vr-pad] the left grip held and Y" and "Light Jak by the left grip" lines, target-powerjak-get-on then each power's
# state, target-darkjak-get-on only at 6.
